# AI Agent Rules (.clinerules)

Refer to [AGENTS.md](AGENTS.md) for the universal project context, architecture, and coding standards.

## 🚦 Always-on Quick Rules
- **Trinity Rule**: Only 3 core modules (`main.py`, `agents.py`, `processor.py`).
- **Structured Policy**: NO REGEX for LLM/VLM outputs. Use `.parse()` + Pydantic.
- **ASR Synergy**: VLM-extracted terms must be in ASR prompts.
- **Type Safety**: PEP 484 hints and Google docstrings are mandatory.
